- Immediately returns error before any receipt updates: e.g., invalid newName returns string; before sync. So no receipt updates.

- If category not found: return 'Category not found.'; also before any updates.

- Duplicate name: check effectiveNames, return 'Category already exists.'; before any updates.

Thus no receipt updates for failures. It protects.

